[
  {
    "text": "THEY CAME IN SIGHT of the coast of Louisiana",
    "start_ind": 5,
    "end_ind": 49
  },
  {
    "text": "they skirted the island of Cuba",
    "start_ind": 240,
    "end_ind": 271
  },
  {
    "text": "They did not try for an immediate landfall",
    "start_ind": 273,
    "end_ind": 315
  },
  {
    "text": "They sailed past the myriad of outlets for the Mississippi River",
    "start_ind": 352,
    "end_ind": 416
  },
  {
    "text": "did not boldly drop anchor before the Spanish city",
    "start_ind": 714,
    "end_ind": 764
  },
  {
    "text": "to make his landfall in a secluded inlet known as Barataria Bay",
    "start_ind": 827,
    "end_ind": 890
  },
  {
    "text": "he moved through the intricate systems of bayous and waterways of the delta country to the back door of New Orleans",
    "start_ind": 904,
    "end_ind": 1019
  },
  {
    "text": "see to their transport into the city themselves",
    "start_ind": 1169,
    "end_ind": 1216
  },
  {
    "text": "They came and went",
    "start_ind": 1689,
    "end_ind": 1707
  },
  {
    "text": "sailing across the Caribbean and in the Gulf of Mexico",
    "start_ind": 2225,
    "end_ind": 2279
  },
  {
    "text": "we step off the ship",
    "start_ind": 4003,
    "end_ind": 4023
  },
  {
    "text": "joining them there by the railing",
    "start_ind": 5803,
    "end_ind": 5836
  },
  {
    "text": "the two of them walking the decks",
    "start_ind": 8203,
    "end_ind": 8236
  },
  {
    "text": "Flora trailed along behind",
    "start_ind": 8265,
    "end_ind": 8291
  },
  {
    "text": "the ship neared the bay",
    "start_ind": 9576,
    "end_ind": 9599
  },
  {
    "text": "they would leave it",
    "start_ind": 9606,
    "end_ind": 9625
  },
  {
    "text": "They scudded into Barataria Bay",
    "start_ind": 9783,
    "end_ind": 9814
  },
  {
    "text": "retired to their bunks",
    "start_ind": 10445,
    "end_ind": 10467
  },
  {
    "text": "Ryan moved about the ship",
    "start_ind": 10571,
    "end_ind": 10596
  },
  {
    "text": "returning now and then",
    "start_ind": 10635,
    "end_ind": 10657
  },
  {
    "text": "In the cabin once more",
    "start_ind": 10822,
    "end_ind": 10844
  },
  {
    "text": "he climbed into the bunk",
    "start_ind": 10913,
    "end_ind": 10937
  },
  {
    "text": "once they reached New Orleans",
    "start_ind": 12931,
    "end_ind": 12960
  },
  {
    "text": "they reached New Orleans",
    "start_ind": 14195,
    "end_ind": 14219
  },
  {
    "text": "The longboat made a number of trips to the ramshackle warehouse",
    "start_ind": 15620,
    "end_ind": 15683
  },
  {
    "text": "a man emerged from the largest of the scruffy dwellings",
    "start_ind": 16011,
    "end_ind": 16066
  },
  {
    "text": "An Indian woman ducked through a doorway",
    "start_ind": 16186,
    "end_ind": 16226
  },
  {
    "text": "turned and went back inside",
    "start_ind": 16302,
    "end_ind": 16329
  },
  {
    "text": "Men came",
    "start_ind": 16609,
    "end_ind": 16617
  },
  {
    "text": "they came",
    "start_ind": 16754,
    "end_ind": 16763
  },
  {
    "text": "they came to greet him",
    "start_ind": 16882,
    "end_ind": 16904
  },
  {
    "text": "he had himself rowed ashore",
    "start_ind": 16910,
    "end_ind": 16937
  },
  {
    "text": "haul his passengers to New Orleans",
    "start_ind": 17012,
    "end_ind": 17046
  },
  {
    "text": "climb into the boats",
    "start_ind": 17203,
    "end_ind": 17223
  },
  {
    "text": "they left the waters of the bay",
    "start_ind": 17558,
    "end_ind": 17589
  },
  {
    "text": "they rode the waterways",
    "start_ind": 18173,
    "end_ind": 18196
  },
  {
    "text": "trending ever to the northeast",
    "start_ind": 18198,
    "end_ind": 18228
  },
  {
    "text": "they darted around the boat",
    "start_ind": 18352,
    "end_ind": 18379
  },
  {
    "text": "they avoided wading far into the water",
    "start_ind": 18714,
    "end_ind": 18752
  },
  {
    "text": "they came to the gates of New Orleans",
    "start_ind": 19029,
    "end_ind": 19066
  },
  {
    "text": "The gate opened and they were inside",
    "start_ind": 19320,
    "end_ind": 19356
  },
  {
    "text": "carriages and pedestrians could pass to the inside courtyards",
    "start_ind": 20116,
    "end_ind": 20177
  },
  {
    "text": "imported from Saint-Domingue",
    "start_ind": 21158,
    "end_ind": 21186
  },
  {
    "text": "they all piled from the wagon",
    "start_ind": 23668,
    "end_ind": 23697
  },
  {
    "text": "Bayou Saint John outside the city where the boats had landed",
    "start_ind": 23733,
    "end_ind": 23793
  },
  {
    "text": "They trooped through the porte cochère and into the stone-paved courtyard",
    "start_ind": 23795,
    "end_ind": 23868
  },
  {
    "text": "skirting a fountain surrounded by ferns and geraniums",
    "start_ind": 23870,
    "end_ind": 23923
  },
  {
    "text": "headed toward a flight of stairs that led up to a gallery",
    "start_ind": 23929,
    "end_ind": 23986
  },
  {
    "text": "Before they reached it",
    "start_ind": 24029,
    "end_ind": 24051
  },
  {
    "text": "a black man stepped forward",
    "start_ind": 24053,
    "end_ind": 24080
  },
  {
    "text": "bring maids and footmen running",
    "start_ind": 24381,
    "end_ind": 24412
  },
  {
    "text": "lead Elene and Devota",
    "start_ind": 24644,
    "end_ind": 24665
  },
  {
    "text": "delivered by a footman",
    "start_ind": 24803,
    "end_ind": 24825
  },
  {
    "text": "Elene and her maid entered",
    "start_ind": 24840,
    "end_ind": 24866
  },
  {
    "text": "a man who had only just arrived in New Orleans",
    "start_ind": 25592,
    "end_ind": 25638
  },
  {
    "text": "Ryan had left it for the Caribbean",
    "start_ind": 25644,
    "end_ind": 25678
  },
  {
    "text": "He would not be back",
    "start_ind": 25759,
    "end_ind": 25779
  },
  {
    "text": "go off visiting",
    "start_ind": 26008,
    "end_ind": 26023
  },
  {
    "text": "crawl into bed",
    "start_ind": 26113,
    "end_ind": 26127
  },
  {
    "text": "sought the room",
    "start_ind": 26307,
    "end_ind": 26322
  },
  {
    "text": "moving toward one of the French doors",
    "start_ind": 27394,
    "end_ind": 27431
  },
  {
    "text": "to be away",
    "start_ind": 28364,
    "end_ind": 28374
  },
  {
    "text": "moved back into the room",
    "start_ind": 29705,
    "end_ind": 29729
  }
]